ec502511301f4345eb37a9d3e2629f1f8e5682886f6460af8c9a6"},"seconds":37.47316908836365,"seed":670349580969838562,"stop":"eos","text":"To solve this problem, we need to calculate the area of the region that needs to be carpeted and padded, and then calculate the cost of the carpet and padding based on the given rates.\n\nFirst, we need to find the area of the region. The region can be divided into two rectangles: a larger rectangle on the left and a smaller rectangle on the right.\n\n1. **Calculate the area of the larger rectangle:**\n   - The dimensions of the larger rectangle are 4 yds by 5 yds.\n   - The area of the larger rectangle is:\n     \\[\n     4 \\, \\text{yds} \\times 5 \\, \\text{yds} = 20 \\, \\text{square yds}\n     \\]\n\n2. **Calculate the area of the smaller rectangle:**\n   - The dimensions of the smaller rectangle are 5 yds by 2 yds.\n   - The area of the smaller rectangle is:\n     \\[\n     5 \\, \\text{yds} \\times 2 \\, \\text{yds} = 10 \\, \\text{square yds}\n     \\]\n\n3. **Calculate the total area of the region:**\n   - The total area is the sum of the areas of the two rectangles:\n     \\[\n     20 \\, \\text{square yds} + 10 \\, \\text{square yds} = 30 \\, \\text{square yds}\n     \\]\n\n4. **Calculate the cost of the carpet:**\n   - The cost of carpet per square yard is $21.95.\n   - The total cost of the carpet is:\n     \\[\n     30 \\, \\text{square yds} \\times 21.95 \\, \\text{\\$/square yd} = 658.50 \\, \\text{\\$}\n     \\]\n\n5. **Calculate the cost of the padding:**\n   - The cost of padding per square yard is $2.55.\n   - The total cost of the padding is:\n     \\[\n     30 \\, \\text{square yds} \\times 2.55 \\, \\text{\\$/square yd} = 76.50 \\, \\text{\\$}\n     \\]\n\n6. **Calculate the total cost:**\n   - The total cost is the sum of the cost of the carpet and the cost of the padding:\n     \\[\n     658.50 \\, \\text{\\$} + 76.50 \\, \\text{\\$} = 735.00 \\, \\text{\\$}\n     \\]\n\nTherefore, the total cost of the carpet and padding needed to exactly cover the room is \\(\\boxed{735.00}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{735.00}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
